  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRANSFORM East Africa Selection Panel Pilot</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRANSFORM Management Team agreed to pilot delegation of project sourcing and selection to an East Africa Selection Panel, composed of regional representatives from Unilever, the FCDO and Ernest and Young. The East Africa Selection Panel will be responsible for local sourcing and selection of projects.</narrative>
